  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A heater supplies energy at a constant rate to 100 kg of water. The specific heat capacity of water is 4.2 kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> K<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. The graph below shows how the temperature of the water varies with time. The gradient of the graph is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{1000}\"></span>.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the power supplied by the heater?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">4.2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{1}\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">4.2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{2}\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">4.2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{3}\"></span> W</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">4.2 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\times\"></span> 10<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{4}\"></span> W</li>\n</ol>"
  },
